---
name: ledger recon wave9
description: Trimmed Wave 8 statistical workflow fixture kept for bundle regression; deontic obligation tests use inline mer in Wave9NorthStarFixtureTests.
triggers:
  - "run ledger recon wave9"
parameters: ledger
---

To run ledger recon wave9 for a ledger:
  let the parity receipt be "parity watch opened".
  assert the parity step succeeds in at least 99% of occurrences within the last 30 days.
  recover from any:
    complete with reason "ledger parity check deferred".
  proceed, and note "; parity watch pass complete" in the parity receipt.
  complete with reason "ledger recon wave9 pass complete".
